        <type>bool</type>
        <definition>bool themis::utils::RateLimiter::try_acquire</definition>
        <argsstring>(double tokens=1.0)</argsstring>
        <name>try_acquire</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::utils::RateLimiter::try_acquire</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>double</type>
          <declname>tokens</declname>
          <defval>1.0</defval>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Attempt to consume <computeroutput>tokens</computeroutput> without blocking. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Try acquire.</para>
<para>Non-blocking operation that checks if sufficient tokens are available in the bucket. If available, tokens are consumed and true is returned. Otherwise, state is unchanged and false is returned.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>tokens</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Number of tokens to acquire (default 1.0) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>true if tokens were available and consumed; false otherwise</para>
</simplesect>
@error_contract <table rows="3" cols="5"><row>
<entry thead="yes"><para>Condition  </para>
</entry><entry thead="yes"><para><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1utils_1a06bcf365c98dd5d12c5d9b66705c6ac7" kindref="member">ErrorCode</ref>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="yes"><para>Severity  </para>
</entry><entry thead="yes"><para>Logging  </para>
</entry><entry thead="yes"><para>Recovery  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>tokens &lt;= 0 (no-op)  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>n/a  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>n/a  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>None  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>Return true  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>Token bucket exhausted (insufficient tokens)  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>RATELIMIT_EXCEEDED (9073)  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>Warning  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>requested, available, rate_per_s  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>Return false (RATE_LIMIT_EXHAUSTED)  </para>
</entry></row>
</table>
</para>
<para>@degradation explicit false return + structured diagnostic on every rejection @bounded_resources<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Tokens capped at burst_size (no unbounded accumulation)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Operation O(1) time complexity</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>@thread_safety Thread-safe via internal mutex (no spin-loops) @performance Sub-microsecond; no sleep/wait</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1utils_1a06bcf365c98dd5d12c5d9b66705c6ac7" kindref="member">ErrorCode</ref> 9070-9079 for concurrency error taxonomy </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>acquire() for blocking variant with automatic retry</para>
</simplesect>
