    <briefdescription>
<para>Token-bucket rate limiter for shared use across modules. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Tokens refill continuously at <computeroutput>rate_per_second</computeroutput> up to <computeroutput>burst_size</computeroutput>. Callers may either poll non-blocking (<computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_rate_limiter_1a09b2ae5423d57bb3210245b8f7ec9a21" kindref="member">try_acquire</ref></computeroutput>) or block until the requested number of tokens is available (<computeroutput>acquire</computeroutput>).</para>
<para>Thread-safety: all public methods are fully thread-safe. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
